abstract: >-
  Code, recorded counts, and tests for counting all matroids on ten elements.
  The totals are 3,232,000,741,644 up to isomorphism and
  11,727,995,799,397,397,461 with labeled elements.
keywords:
  - matroids
  - enumeration
  - exact counting
  - reproducible computation
